<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Income tax: annual income in Kenya pounds (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>{@nm@} earns a salary of Ksh \( {@S0@} \) per month. (Remember: K£1 \( = \) Ksh 20.)</p>
<p>A tax authority uses the following <strong>annual</strong> tax table, with rates given in shillings per Kenya pound:</p>
<table style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;margin:6px 0;">
<tr><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Annual income (K£)</th><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Rate (Ksh per K£)</th></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">First K£ 9,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">2</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Next K£ 9,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">3</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Over K£ 18,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">4</td></tr>
</table>
<p>(a) Find the annual income in shillings.</p>
<div>Annual income \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Convert the annual income to Kenya pounds.</p>
<div>Annual income \( = \) K£ [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Find the annual gross tax, in shillings.</p>
<div>Gross tax \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> \( 12 \times {@S0@} = {@Y0@} \) shillings.</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> Divide by 20 to change shillings into Kenya pounds: \( \dfrac{ {@Y0@} }{20} = \) K£ \( {@K0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> Split the income into the bands:</p>
\[
\begin{align*}
\text{First K£ } 9{,}000 \times 2 &= 18{,}000 \\
\text{Next K£ } 9{,}000 \times 3 &= 27{,}000 \\
\text{Remaining K£ } {@K0 - 18000@} \times 4 &= {@4*(K0 - 18000)@} \\
\text{Gross tax} &= \text{Ksh } {@gt@}
\end{align*}
\]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
